export async function enrollmentBenefits(token:string):Promise<EnrollmentBenefits>{const r=await fetch(`${API}/schooling/enrollment-benefits`,{headers:auth(token)});if(!r.ok)return {large_family:null,staff_child:null,staff:[]};return r.json()}
export type EnrollmentChildInput={student_id?:string|null;last_name?:string|null;middle_name?:string|null;first_name?:string|null;class_id:string;gender?:'M'|'F'|'X'|null;birth_date?:string|null;birth_place?:string|null;nationality?:string|null;address?:string|null;previous_school?:string|null;origin?:'NEW'|'REENROLLMENT'|'TRANSFER_IN';origin_school?:string|null;staff_member_id?:string|null;staff_beneficiary?:boolean;large_family_beneficiary?:boolean;notes?:string|null};
